CONDITIONAL STATEMENT-=====>

1->
If statement- 
Syntax:
if (condition)
{
    //code
}

2->
If-Else statement- 
Syntax:
if (condition)
{
    //True code
}
else
{
    //False code
}

3->
Nested If-Else statement- 
Syntax:
if (condition)
{
    if (condition)
    {
        //code
    }
    else
    {
        //code
    }
else
{
    //code
}
}

4->
Nested Else-If statement- 
Syntax:
if (condition)
{
    //code
}
else if (condition)
{
    //code
}
else if (condition)
{
    //code
}
else
{
    //code
}

5->
Switch statement- 
Syntax:
switch (expression)
{
case 1:
    //code
    break;
case 2:
    //code
    break;    
case n:
    //code
    break;
default:
    break;
}
    
